* P - RESIDENT MEMORY DISPLAY

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* P - RESIDENT MEMORY DISPLAY

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    P [start-hex [end-hex]]

Displays memory in hexadecimal form. With no address, starts at 0100H and
displays a default block.

The installed command table token is P (the package describes the function
as Peek). Memory can contain private session data. Keep output on the
private console.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
